Date: Sat, 12 Sep 2026 19:59:47 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 18/20] ASoC: codecs: wcn-bt-slim: add the WCN6750 (product
 0x221)

The Nothing Phone (1) (SM7325) routes Bluetooth SCO over SLIMbus like surya. Its stock device tree
describes the chip on slim@3ac0000 as elemental address [00 01 21 02 17 02] and the interface device
as [00 00 21 02 17 02]: manufacturer 0x217, product 0x221, device index 1 and 0.
---
 sound/soc/codecs/wcn-bt-slim.c | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/sound/soc/codecs/wcn-bt-slim.c b/sound/soc/codecs/wcn-bt-slim.c
index f7aee9794..887b339f2 100644
--- a/sound/soc/codecs/wcn-bt-slim.c
+++ b/sound/soc/codecs/wcn-bt-slim.c
@@ -1452,6 +1452,8 @@ static void wcn_bt_slim_debugfs_init(void)
 static const struct slim_device_id wcn_bt_slim_id[] = {
 	{ 0x217, 0x220, 0x0, 0x0 },	/* interface device */
 	{ 0x217, 0x220, 0x1, 0x0 },	/* ported generic device */
+	{ 0x217, 0x221, 0x0, 0x0 },	/* WCN6750 interface device */
+	{ 0x217, 0x221, 0x1, 0x0 },	/* WCN6750 ported generic device */
 	{}
 };
 MODULE_DEVICE_TABLE(slimbus, wcn_bt_slim_id);
-- 
